more={1889:'Footer13. map→odom→base_link chain with laser/camera labels; table defines global, odometry, body and sensor reference frames. TF maintains supplied spatial relationships, not self-calibration. No matrix product is printed.',1890:'Footer14. Wheel odometry, IMU, RP lidar scan feed EKF then filtered pose. Drift and uncertainty motivate fusion. No covariance/measurement-model configuration or guaranteed improvement proof.',1891:'Footer15. LiDAR360/FOV range/fixed plane versus depth camera low/off-plane obstacles and narrower FOV. Costmap legend lethal/inscribed/high/low/free; finite footprint can overlap obstacle although centerline misses it.',1892:'Footer16. SLAM jointly estimates pose/map; 2D occupancy grid, loop closure, new areas. Flow sensor→pose→map→update→repeat.',1893:'Footer17. Teleoperation scan collection, EKF odometry, occupancy update, saved map for AMCL/Nav2. Screenshots initial scan and finished map, not numeric validation.',1894:'Footer18. AMCL uses prebuilt map and particle hypotheses, compares scans, updates probability, outputs pose/orientation/confidence. A display marker cannot certify unique posterior concentration.',1895:'Footer19. Goal pose has x,y,theta; RViz2DGoalPose and orientation arrow; workflowselect→plan→move→reach. Screen durability row visible; no new API verification attempted.',1896:'Footer20. Global route map/currentpose/goal, static obstacles, replan ifchanged. Optimal/smooth are stated goals, no algorithm/costproof supplied.',1897:'Footer21. Longer green trace toleft labeled Global Planned Path; near-red-robot short trace labeled Local Planner Path. Local planning evaluates trajectories and produces velocities. Still does not quantify distance or tracking error.',1898:'Footer22. Sensor box→Processing Nodes; branches right to Navigation and down to Motor Controller→Mobile Robot. Node table says independent executable but no process/launch layout. Topic async, service request-response, action longtask, TF transforms.',1899:'Footer23. Nav2 table: planner globalpath, controller trajectory, BT behavior, costmaps obstacles, recovery failures. Diagram contains Behavior Server; no exact deployed orchestration asserted.',1900:'Footer24. Live RGB detection, aligned depth for distance, annotated images, Jetson execution. Boxes/class/confidence flow; stilllabelsnotexactruntimeproof. No pinhole equations printed.',1901:'Footer25. Simulation virtualrobot/world, dynamics/sensors/interactions, sameROSstack, sensoroutputs and visualizedmapping/navigation. No worldfiles/code supplied.',1902:'Footer26. URDF/Xacro bodyproperties, virtualobstacles, simulatedLiDAR/RGBD/IMU/encoders, motionkinematics/dynamics, navigationalgorithms. Diagram repeats RobotDecision; no extra invented stage.',1903:'Footer27. Teleoperation/Gazebo andRVizmapgeneration historicalscreenshot, playback4×. Notrobot physicalspeed.',1904:'Footer28. Gazebo/RViz with preconfiguredworld/map historicalscreenshot, playback3×. No fullprogram.',1905:'Footer29. Realrobot corridor plusRViz loadedmap and detections; playback3.25×. No fresh experiment, metric or success probability.',1906:'Footer30. Summarizes reported integratedAMR/differentialdrive/PID/fusion/SLAM/AMCL/Nav2/YOLO andvalidation. No added quantitativeevidence.',1907:'Footer31. Bibliography and links only. No restricted external route attempted.',1908:'Footer32. Thankyou only.'}
